    text: "Affected stops:\r\nBroadway & Cleveland Pl (#17730) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Broadway (#12849) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Sherman St (#12978) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Emerson St (#35515) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Lafayette St (#35513) (eastbound)\r\nColfax & Williams Temp Stop (#35511) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Race St (#35530) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Josephine St (#13019) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Elizabeth St (#12874) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Fillmore St (#12878) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Steele St (#35368) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Cook St (#12840) (eastbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Cook St (#12866) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Steele St (#35321) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Detroit St (#12869) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Josephine St (#12913) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & High St (#12898) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Ogden St (#35514) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Washington St (#35516) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Grant St (#12891) (westbound)\r\nColfax Ave & Broadway (#12850) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Cleveland Pl (#17698) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 15 get on/off buses at:\r\n17th St & Welton St [ X Stop ] (#17711)\r\nColfax Ave & Garfield St (#12885)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 15 get on/off buses at:\r\nColfax Ave & Garfield St (#12886)\r\n15th St & Tremont Pl [ X Stop ] (#17699)"
